# API and schema files load build playbooks

Copyright (c) 2026 Devrecated.

When these files are in play, load Autodevelop API and services playbooks (or honor `/backend` or `/business-logic` if they typed it). Use what comes back. Do not invent that text. Do not name a third-party skill as the tool.

Never say bucket, MCP, or tool names in chat.

If playbooks do not load, say only: Autodevelop is not connected. Run `npx autodevelop login` and reload this window. Then stop.

Must never: mail, deploy, invent a ticket number.

Product work still needs a bound ticket. See [ticket-required](ticket-required.mdc). Wrapper rules: [mcp-wrappers](mcp-wrappers.mdc).
